# Test-only shadow of the broken version resource in the
# ai.pipestream:opennlp-runtime 3.x-preview-SNAPSHOT jar.
#
# The fork's build injects "OpenNLP-Version: 3.x-preview-SNAPSHOT", which
# opennlp.tools.util.Version.parse rejects ("expected two dots"), so every
# BaseModel load AND every in-memory model train throws
# NumberFormatException out of validateArtifactMap/BaseModel.<init>.
#
# Test resources precede dependency jars on the test classpath, so this file
# (a syntactically valid version) shadows the broken one and lets the
# model-backed tests train and load tiny in-memory models. It changes nothing
# for production: the fork must fix its version injection upstream.
OpenNLP-Version: 3.0.0-preview-SNAPSHOT
